<% content_for :title, "Disclaimer · Nuclear Directory" %>
<% content_for :head do %>
  <link rel="canonical" href="<%= disclaimer_url %>">
  <meta name="description" content="Nuclear Directory is built from public sources. It may be incomplete or out of date, and it isn't safety or investment advice.">
<% end %>
<%= render layout: "pages/frame", locals: { current: :disclaimer, title: "Disclaimer", updated: "October 2026",
      summary: "Nuclear Directory is a reference built from public sources. Check a fact's source before you rely on it.",
      facts: [ { label: "Built from", value: "Public sources" }, { label: "Checked", value: "Fact by fact" },
               { label: "Advice", value: "None given" }, { label: "Corrections", value: "Welcome" } ] } do %>
  <section class="nd-info__sec" aria-labelledby="sources">
    <h2 id="sources" class="nd-info__h">Sources</h2>
    <p>Every fact comes from a public source: company announcements, regulator filings and news reports. Each fact links to the source it came from and shows when we last checked it.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="nd-info__sec" aria-labelledby="currency">
    <h2 id="currency" class="nd-info__h">Accuracy</h2>
    <p>The directory may be incomplete or out of date. Companies change names, deals end and plans move. Check the source and its date before you rely on a fact.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="nd-info__sec" aria-labelledby="advice">
    <h2 id="advice" class="nd-info__h">Advice</h2>
    <p>Nothing here is safety, engineering, legal or investment advice.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="nd-info__sec" aria-labelledby="endorsement">
    <h2 id="endorsement" class="nd-info__h">Endorsement</h2>
    <p>A company, plant or deal appears because a source reports it, not because we recommend it.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="nd-info__sec" aria-labelledby="mistakes">
    <h2 id="mistakes" class="nd-info__h">Corrections</h2>
    <p>Use "Report a correction" next to any fact, or email <%= mail_to DirectoryHelper::CORRECTIONS_EMAIL, nil, class: "nd-link" %>. We check every correction against its source.</p>
  </section>
<% end %>
